forgive, forgo (relinquish), forlorn, forpined, forsake, forspent, forswear, forwearied, & forworn, is unconnected with the English words for & fore, & means away, out, completely,
===
*forgive, forgo* (relinquish), *forlorn, forpined, forsake, forspent, forswear, forwearied,* & *forworn,* is unconnected with the English words *for* & *fore,* & means away, out, completely,
